Tory via tmz - The jury in Lindsay Clancy’s murder case was unable to reach a verdict, and the judge just declared a mistrial. They deliberated for 38 hours ... 2 hours after the judge said the lone holdout could remain on the jury. The jury has sent the judge a note ... saying it was with a heavy heart that the jury could not reach a unanimous verdict.

What would you need to see in the record before changing your mind?

@rapwire247
